					<![CDATA[
						 <div id="wiki-tabview-23080d385733dddce69378054257bf2c" class="yui-navset"> <ul class="yui-nav"> <li class="selected"><a href="javascript:;"><em>职员档案</em></a></li> <li><a href="javascript:;"><em>叙事外资料</em></a></li> </ul> <div class="yui-content"> <div id="wiki-tab-0-0"> <div class="pictures4mobile"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:225px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/placeholder-mcd-s-authorpage/placeholder1" style="width:225px;" alt="placeholder1" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:225px;"> <p>Dr. Placeholder，约摄于1996。</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="pictures4desk"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:225px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/placeholder-mcd-s-authorpage/placeholder1" style="width:225px;" alt="placeholder1" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:225px;"> <p>Dr. Placeholder，约摄于1996。</p> </div> </div> </div> <p><strong>标识符：</strong>Dr. Placeholder McDoctorate, PhD.</p> <p><strong>安保权限：</strong>5</p> <p><strong>职责：</strong>超形上学部部长</p> <p><strong>年表：</strong>因在计算机科学领域表现突出而特招聘用。1993年被派往Site-15的信息与技术部门。1996年因于收容<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5241">SCP-5241</a>事件中表现突出而被晋升为部长。1999年晋升为站点主管。2002年应个人要求被调往Site-87，并调入超形上学部。2011年因于理论性超形上学方面取得显著进展被晋升为部长。</p> <p><strong>引语：</strong>“确实，我知道我的名字很搞笑。不行，我不能跟你讲。有些时候现实就是这么<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-5242">没有意义</a>。”</p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-1" style="display:none"> <div class="pictures4mobile"> <div class="scp-image-block block-center" style="width:240px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/placeholder-mcd-s-authorpage/me" style="width:240px;" alt="me" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:240px;"> <p>我，当时很快乐。</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="pictures4desk"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:240px;"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wikidot.com/local--files/placeholder-mcd-s-authorpage/me" style="width:240px;" alt="me" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:240px;"> <p>我，当时很快乐。</p> </div> </div> </div> <p>你们好。我的名字是Nathan，又名<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606423065" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span>，又名逻辑家。我是个19岁的加拿大人，正在（写作的时候）接受音乐教育。我从没真正认为自己是个作家，也没觉得写作是件我喜欢的事情，直到我来到了SCP维基；我对这个社区以及其基本概念的了解已经有好几年了，但直到2020年的四五月才开始在维基上真正地阅读以及互动。突然间，我意识到我可以把那些我不太感兴趣也不太了解的奇怪又不相关的话题搬过来，学着用一种人们感兴趣的方式呈现出来——这也可能是我开始写作之前的最大缺点。我现在偶尔会写点东西，有时候人们会喜欢，挺酷的。</p> </div> </div> </div> <div style="clear:both; height: 0px; font-size: 1px"></div> <div class="infobox"> <p style="text-align: center;"><tt><strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6536693&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606423065" alt="Placeholder McD" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6536693)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/placeholder-mcd" >Placeholder McD</a></span></strong></tt></p> <p style="text-align: center;">共8篇</p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>SCPs</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5242">SCP-整数</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofscp-5242 161 -44"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>161 -44</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofscp-5242 {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/mcdoctorate-s-proposal">McDoctorate的提案</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofmcdoctorate-s-proposal 18 -23"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>18 -23</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofmcdoctorate-s-proposal {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5241">SCP-5241</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofscp-5241 65 -9"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>65 -9</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofscp-5241 {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>故事</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/ai-classification-guide">AI分类指南</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofai-classification-guide 52 -16"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>52 -16</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofai-classification-guide {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/fragmented-compiled">破碎编译</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoffragmented-compiled 26 -12"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>26 -12</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoffragmented-compiled {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>其它</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/abridged-retirement-proposals">删节版引退提案</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofabridged-retirement-proposals 9 -8"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>9 -8</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofabridged-retirement-proposals {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/placeholder-mcd-s-authorpage">占位符 人事档案</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofplaceholder-mcd-s-authorpage 39 -5"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>39 -5</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofplaceholder-mcd-s-authorpage {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/theme:retro-aiad-theme">复古 AIAD 版式</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingoftheme:retro-aiad-theme 18 -9"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>18 -9</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteoftheme:retro-aiad-theme �4366�"><span style="white-space: pre-wrap;">&#32;</span></span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <div style="text-align: center;"> <hr /> <h2><span>合著</span></h2> <hr /></div> <div class="preview yesyes" style="height:7.7em;overflow:hidden;"> <p><strong><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-5841">SCP-5841</a></strong><br /> <span class="ratingofscp-5841 49 -5"><em>主站评分：</em>+<tt><strong>49 -5</strong></tt></span><br /> <span class="collabnoteofscp-5841 {$note}">{$note}</span><br /> <em>等待翻译&#8230;</em></p> </div> <hr /> <div style="text-align: center;"> <div class="licensebox22"> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">‡&nbsp;隐藏授权&nbsp;/&nbsp;引用</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p>请按如下方式引用此页：</p> <p>更多详情请参阅<a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/licensing-guide">授权指南</a>。<br /> <strong>授权信息</strong></p> <div class="content-separator" style="display: none:"></div> <blockquote> <p><strong>文件名：</strong>placeholder1.png<br /> <strong>图像名：</strong>placeholder1<br /> <strong>图像作者：</strong>thispersondoesnotexist.com<br /> <strong>授权协议：</strong>公有领域<br /> <strong>来源链接：