&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: firebrick; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;嘤嘤嘤，您并非站务我的朋友。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;trans-quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;操，老子走了。&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;你才是垃圾，萨笔。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: firebrick; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;这个人事页才是你永远的家啊。有事没事回来玩，说不定我再写点东西，嗷。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;trans-quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[该终端正在退出]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: firebrick; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;诶哥别走啊，我这放人设。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;trans-quote&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;得得得得得得得。哦看在上帝的份上，如果你再欺骗我的话，我就会用隔壁&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6285604&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423067&quot; alt=&quot;Chris Evertworth&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6285604)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chris-evertworth&quot;  &gt;Chris Evertworth&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;家几十年没洗的臭尖皮鞋狠狠的亲吻你的屁股。哦我发誓我会这么做的。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: firebrick; font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;哦你这只&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3396110&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423067&quot; alt=&quot;Kcorena&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3396110)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kcorena&quot;  &gt;Kcorena&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;家那只该死的鹅，瞧瞧你那糟糕的翻译腔，我发誓它简直像隔壁&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423067&quot; alt=&quot;BruceWu0463&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463&quot;  &gt;BruceWu0463&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;家拥有6个乳房的猫娘一样令人厌恶，我发誓你是撒旦的手下。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
