ki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:of-cabbages-and-kings">有关卷心菜和国王</a></p> <hr /> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/wanderers:are-you-here">你在吗？</a></p> <hr /></div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;中心页和竞赛</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;以后或许会变多？</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/144-hour-jam-contest-two">144小时连写竞赛2</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;艺作页</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;好像我更关注艺作页的有趣性而不是艺术性……</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-silly-doodles">SCP沙雕涂鸦</a></p> <hr /> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/the-lilyflower-art-page">LilyFlower艺作页</a></p> <p>传单风太棒了</p> <hr /></div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> <div class="collapsible-block"> <div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;模板</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none"> <div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;第一次翻模板有点激动</a></div> <div class="collapsible-block-content"> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/component:void-post">Void消息模板</a></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-4" style="display:none"> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">缓……慢……增……长</span></p> <p><br /></p> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/more-mice">多子多福</a></p> <p>凭着脑内突然浮现的画面随手写的creepypasta，没想到存活了！</p> <hr /> <p><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/eurya-art">Eurya的摸鱼集</a></p> <p><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">画画最重要的是什么？是开心</span></p> <p><br /></p> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-5" style="display:none"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="https://i.loli.net/2020/10/04/cJLQeEagPm6y1jf.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="cJLQeEagPm6y1jf.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>陆柃<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-463641-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>的自画像，但似乎还未完成</p> </div> </div> <ul> <li>一个除了拥有过于茂密的反重力头发和小龙虾耳环之外一切都很正常的普通女生，就读于实为Site-CN-91的██大学，尽管本人对此毫不知情。</li> </ul> <ul> <li>虽然外表看上去是个运动少女，但其实是个一旦有可能就不愿挪窝的宅。</li> </ul> <ul> <li>虽然热衷于尝试各种新奇的食物，但对于任何含有甜椒的菜都会避而远之。</li> </ul> <ul> <li>虽然喜欢怪谈和恐怖类作品，但至今不敢一个人看《闪灵》，即使是在白天。</li> </ul> <ul> <li>虽然自称喜欢猫，但是养的猫不喜欢她。</li> </ul> <p><br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">以前脑过的人设，但没有用她写过文……</span></p> <div class="footnotes-footer"> <div class="title">脚注</div> <div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-463641-1"><a href="javascript:;" >1</a>. 如果她有名字。</div> </div> </div> <div id="wiki-tab-0-6" style="display:none"> <div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:300px;"><img src="https://i.loli.net/2020/10/04/HNlLqeauoWiZFJc.jpg" style="width:300px;" alt="HNlLqeauoWiZFJc.jpg" class="image" /> <div class="scp-image-caption" style="width:300px;"> <p>正在翻译的Eurya。</p> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p><span style="font-size:80%;">你永远也不知道电脑那边的是不是一只猫</span></p> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> </div> </div> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /></p> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p><em>.<br /> .<br /> .</em><br /> <em>天末故人情。</em></p> </div> <p><br /> <br /> <br /></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eurya" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4369343&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068" alt="Eurya" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4369343)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/eurya" >Eurya</a></span></p> 
