&lt;p&gt;好耶！——摸鱼太久维基语法都快忘了的屑&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5375092&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;RainTree&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5375092)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/raintree&quot;  &gt;RainTree&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;来了来了，恭喜人事页୧( ⁼̴̶̤̀ω⁼̴̶̤́ )૭&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aplous&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6236003&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;aplous&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6236003)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/aplous&quot;  &gt;aplous&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;好耶！（同是高三党比我强太多了(ʃƪ ˘ ³˘)）——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6127045&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Fishbone&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6127045)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-fishbone&quot;  &gt;Dr Fishbone&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;是的，只要用了cn1210的CSS的文我都会出一篇parody，比如cn1485，我倒要看看以后怎么把cn1463给parody了&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;好，想出来了，我要写破碎之神教会被集体多重人格化，出现专门功能性的分裂意识——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5480202&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;sciencekiller&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5480202)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sciencekiller&quot;  &gt;sciencekiller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;好耶，方便娘化（貌似是第二个纯纯少女的作者页？）——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6114202&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;Frozen starry sky&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6114202)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/frozen-starry-sky&quot;  &gt;Frozen starry sky&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;我要看女装，不然就&lt;em&gt;Explosion&lt;/em&gt;——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/josephjoestar&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6159447&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;JosephJoestar&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6159447)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/josephjoestar&quot;  &gt;JosephJoestar&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;没错，这是留言（确信——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5992128&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;Swred&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5992128)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/swred&quot;  &gt;Swred&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;啥时候把你写死呢【 &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djpieplus&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6603529&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;djpieplus&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6603529)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/djpieplus&quot;  &gt;djpieplus&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;老吴女装gkd（突然兴奋 ——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5474061&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;Auroriaaaaa&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5474061)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/auroriaaaaa&quot;  &gt;Auroriaaaaa&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;不错，加油哦。——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4423816&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;Dr_Naxurt&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4423816)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-naxurt&quot;  &gt;Dr_Naxurt&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;恭喜Bruce酱！！快写Bruce快写！orz——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6062512&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;YUANNN&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6062512)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yuannn&quot;  &gt;YUANNN&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;嫩粉配女装，少女心小哥哥老吴！——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6591621&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;Confucian Lee&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6591621)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/confucian-lee&quot;  &gt;Confucian Lee&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;迟到的恭喜，棒极了wwwww——&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4020589&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;Just_We&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4020589)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/just-we&quot;  &gt;Just_We&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;是高三党大佬，我死了（菜的安详）——&lt;span class=&quot;error-inline&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;James Holy Xu&lt;/em&gt; 不匹配任何一个现有的用户名&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;by &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5526785&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606423068&quot; alt=&quot;BruceWu0463&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5526785)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/brucewu0463&quot;  &gt;BruceWu0463&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
