&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-771132-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. 啊啦啊啦&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-771132-3&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;3&lt;/a&gt;. planC警告&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-771132-4&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;4&lt;/a&gt;. Explosion！&lt;/div&gt;
